      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "斯摩棱斯克到布列斯特是681公里，从明斯克到斯摩棱",
        "斯克是331公里.求从莫斯科到明斯克的距离.用两种",
        "方法列式解题."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "441",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简下列各式：",
        "1) $0.4+(m-22)$；　　4) $(16-a)-20.7$；",
        "2) $(6-x)+48.7$；　　5) $p-(1.4+p)$；",
        "3) $-0.16-(4.04-m)$；6) $-a+(a-1.1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "442",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "去掉下列各式中的括号，再求值：",
        "1) $-10+7+(10-11)$；",
        "2) $4-18-(9-18)$；",
        "3) $-2.4+6.5-(-6.5+4-8)$；",
        "4) $3+0.7+(3.1-10-2.9)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "443",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简下列各式：",
        "1) $m-(n+m)$；　　6) $P+(-m+k-p)$；",
        "2) $(n+x)-x$；　　7) $-a-(m-a+p)$；",
        "3) $a-(a-b)$；　　8) $n+(k-a-n)$；",
        "4) $7+(n-7)$；　　9) $-(m-a)-(k+a)$；",
        "5) $-8.3+(-x+8.3)$；10) $m-(a+m)-(a-m)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "444",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简下式再求值：",
        "$-y-k-(-y+b-m-k)$，",
        "1) 当$y=-6.6,b=-8.1,m=5,k=3$时；",
        "2) 当$b=-10.7,m=-22.3$时."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "445",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "列出下列每二式的差并化简：",
        "1) $-6+15$和$4-6$；　　3) $-3+a$和$a+60.1$；",
        "2) $m-25$和$25+m$；　　4) $32-n$和$-n+40.7$；"
      ]
    },
